				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "dc7c3e9a-c9c4-548b-8390-7dbc734c32eb")
	)
	(text "H1, H2: the shell's post holes, 5.127 mm NPTH."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.7 182.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0ddb48a2-7172-5981-8331-5dfa2e24dc1a")
	)
	(text "Power tree: VIN is the higher of the console's +5V (VSYS, edge pin 43) and USB VBUS (usb sheet), each through\nan SS34 Schottky (D1, D2): neither source back-feeds the other, and a cart on USB never powers a console that is off.\nC29 100 uF and C25 10 uF hold VIN.  U2 AP63203, 3.3 V / 2 A synchronous buck (4.7 uH, 22 uF + 100 nF out), makes 3V3,\nthe board's one logic rail: the RP2354A (its core regulator makes 1V1, rp-core), the ESP32-S3, the CP2102N, the\nmicroSD and the status LED.  VSYS and VBUS are global: the edge (cart-bus) and the USB-C (usb) carry them here."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 109.22 66.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5d3f8604-8324-5ac8-b388-c98f94de73f5")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
